[{"content":"You can call these tools (parameters are JSON Schema; \"required\" lists the required arguments, and \"default\" is the value used when an optional argument is left out):\n\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Flights_2_SearchOnewayFlight\",\n    \"description\": \"Search for one-way flights between two airports on a given date and list the options with prices.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"origin_airport\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"IATA code of the departure airport, e.g. 'JFK' for New York JFK.\"\n        },\n        \"destination_airport\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"IATA code of the arrival airport, e.g. 'LHR' for London Heathrow.\"\n        },\n        \"departure_date\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Date of departure, formatted as YYYY-MM-DD.\"\n        },\n        \"number_of_tickets\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"description\": \"Number of passenger tickets to price, between 1 and 9.\",\n          \"default\": 1\n        },\n        \"seating_class\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Cabin class to search in.\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"Economy\",\n            \"Premium Economy\",\n            \"Business\",\n            \"First\"\n          ],\n          \"default\": \"Economy\"\n        },\n        \"nonstop_only\": {\n          \"type\": \"boolean\",\n          \"description\": \"Only return flights without a connection.\",\n          \"default\": false\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"origin_airport\",\n        \"destination_airport\",\n        \"departure_date\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Flights_2_GetFlightStatus\",\n    \"description\": \"Get the live status of one scheduled flight: gate, departure and arrival times, delays or cancellation.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"flight_number\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Airline flight number, e.g. 'BA117', exactly as printed on the ticket.\"\n        },\n        \"date\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Scheduled departure date of the flight, formatted as YYYY-MM-DD.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"flight_number\",\n        \"date\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Banking_1_TransferMoney\",\n    \"description\": \"Transfer money from one of the user's accounts to another account number, executed immediately.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"amount\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\",\n          \"description\": \"Amount to transfer in the account currency, e.g. 125.5.\"\n        },\n        \"recipient_account\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Recipient's account number or IBAN, exactly as given.\"\n        },\n        \"account_type\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Which of the user's accounts to use.\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"checking\",\n            \"savings\"\n          ],\n          \"default\": \"checking\"\n        },\n        \"memo\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Reference text the recipient sees on their statement.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"amount\",\n        \"recipient_account\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"getCurrentTime\",\n    \"description\": \"Returns the current local time in ISO 8601 format.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"timezone\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The timezone for which the current time is requested, in the format of 'Area/Location' (e.g., 'America/New_York'). If not provided, defaults to the server's local timezone.\",\n          \"default\": \"local\"\n        },\n        \"include_date\": {\n          \"type\": \"boolean\",\n          \"description\": \"Determines whether the date should be included in the time string. If set to true, the date is included. Defaults to false.\",\n          \"default\": false\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": []\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"calculate_tax\",\n    \"description\": \"Calculates the applicable sales tax for a given purchase amount and jurisdiction. The function returns the total amount with tax.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"purchase_amount\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\",\n          \"description\": \"The total purchase amount in dollars.\"\n        },\n        \"state\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The U.S. state abbreviation where the purchase is made, such as 'CA' for California or 'NY' for New York.\"\n        },\n        \"county\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The county within the state where the purchase is made. This is optional and used to calculate local tax rates.\"\n        },\n        \"city\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The city within the county for local tax rates. Optional and only used if the county is provided.\"\n        },\n        \"tax_exempt\": {\n          \"type\": \"boolean\",\n          \"description\": \"Indicates whether the purchase is tax-exempt.\",\n          \"default\": false\n        },\n        \"discount_rate\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\",\n          \"description\": \"The discount rate as a percentage if applicable. Optional.\",\n          \"default\": 0\n        },\n        \"apply_special_tax\": {\n          \"type\": \"boolean\",\n          \"description\": \"A flag to apply special tax rules based on item type or promotions. Optional.\",\n          \"default\": false\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"purchase_amount\",\n        \"state\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n]\n\nRequest: Find flights from YYZ to JFK on 2026-09-01.\n\nReply with only a JSON array of the tool calls that fulfil the request, each of the form {\"name\": \"<tool name>\", \"arguments\": {...}}, where \"arguments\" is a JSON object (not a string). When the request needs several calls, list them all. Reply with [] if no tool fits the request, or if the request does not give a value for a required argument: never guess one. Include every required argument. Include an optional argument only if the request asks for a value for it; otherwise leave it out and the tool applies its default. Give each value the type its schema declares: JSON numbers for integer and number, true or false for boolean, and strings for string, copied exactly as written.","role":"user"},{"content":"[{\"name\":\"Flights_2_SearchOnewayFlight\",\"arguments\":{\"origin_airport\":\"YYZ\",\"destination_airport\":\"JFK\",\"departure_date\":\"2026-09-01\"}}]","role":"assistant"},{"content":"Tool results:\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Flights_2_SearchOnewayFlight\",\n    \"result\": [\n      {\n        \"flight_number\": \"AF575\",\n        \"departs\": \"2026-09-01T13:00\",\n        \"price_usd\": 293\n      },\n      {\n        \"flight_number\": \"LH101\",\n        \"departs\": \"2026-09-01T08:15\",\n        \"price_usd\": 415\n      },\n      {\n        \"flight_number\": \"KL938\",\n        \"departs\": \"2026-09-01T14:30\",\n        \"price_usd\": 605\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]\n\nRequest: What's the status of the cheapest one?\n\nReply as before: only a JSON array of tool calls, or [] if no tool fits or a required value is missing.","role":"user"},{"content":"[{\"name\":\"Flights_2_GetFlightStatus\",\"arguments\":{\"flight_number\":\"AF575\",\"date\":\"2026-09-01\"}}]","role":"assistant"},{"content":"Tool results:\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Flights_2_GetFlightStatus\",\n    \"